        "content": "```python\ndef solution():\n    units_sold = 350\n    selling_price = 40\n    inventory_levels = [100, 150, 200]  # Oldest to newest\n    unit_costs = [20, 25, 30]\n\n    revenue = units_sold * selling_price\n    units_remaining = units_sold\n    cogs = 0\n\n    for i in range(len(inventory_levels) - 1, -1, -1):\n        units_from_batch = min(units_remaining, inventory_levels[i])\n        cogs += units_from_batch * unit_costs[i]\n        units_remaining -= units_from_batch\n\n    gross_profit = revenue - cogs\n    return round(gross_profit)\n```",
